{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["<b>And you shall put a space between one drove and another.</b> In order to satisfy the eye of that wicked man and to trace out for him the abundance of the gift." "<b>And in the Midrash:</b> ורוח תשימו בין עדר ובין עדר — Jacob said before the Holy One, blessed be He: Master of the universe, if troubles come upon Israel, do not bring them one after another, but give them relief from their troubles. This comes to hint that the taxes and duties that the children of Esau will exact will be with relief and with a space between one and the next."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:17:11.334535889Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}